      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NAN SAID NO (1) held his own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only 1.5 lengths (22.57) behind Urban Tiger at Maitland. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Makes plenty of appeal. GREENGROCER TOM (4) is in sizzling form lately, rocketing around this track in 17.53 to score two back then following on with a 17.46 win over 324m at this track. Has the ability and can measure up again. PURE HAPPINESS (6) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and two placings from six starts. Hit the frame latest (17.60) when third at this track in a Grade 5. Can feature in the finish. LEVI DESIGN (2) is worth including.",
